<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Hi,</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;"><strong><%= @owner.username %></strong> shared the address book <strong><%= @addressbook.displayname %></strong> with you (<%= @share.permission %> access).</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="background-color: #0d6efd; border-radius: 8px;">
      <a href="<%= @accept_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">Accept Invitation</a>
